    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-05-23</title>\n    <style>\n        /* Hacker News-inspired CSS styling */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .header-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .header-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header-date {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav {\n            padding: 8px 0;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav a {\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        main {\n            padding: 20px 0;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 6px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 14px;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag-workflow {\n            background-color: #ffe4d4;\n        }\n\n        .tag-open-source {\n            background-color: #d4f0d4;\n        }\n\n        .tag-specific {\n            background-color: #d4e4f0;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 6px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .update-feature {\n            background-color: #e4f0d4;\n            color: #4a6b2a;\n        }\n\n        .update-release {\n            background-color: #d4e4f0;\n            color: #2a4a6b;\n        }\n\n        .update-announcement {\n            background-color: #f0e4d4;\n            color: #6b4a2a;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            margin: 8px 0;\n            padding: 8px;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #555;\n        }\n\n        .insight-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .section-count {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-left: 8px;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            header {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n                border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 30px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"header-content\">\n                <div class=\"header-title\">Agentic Coding Research Report</div>\n                <div class=\"header-date\">May 23, 2026</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"header-nav\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#new\">new</a>\n            <a href=\"#updates\">updates</a>\n            <a href=\"#insights\">insights</a>\n            <a href=\"#about\">about</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section (40%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"new\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    New Products <span class=\"section-count\">4</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://antigravity.google\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity 2.0</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Standalone desktop app for orchestrating multiple AI agents in parallel with scheduled background tasks, subagent workflows, and native integrations with AI Studio, Firebase, and Android. Breaks the 'prompt, wait, respond' pattern.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag tag-workflow\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n                        <span>| May 22, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Google just separated the agent manager from the IDE and shipped it as its own desktop app.\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://testsprite.com\" target=\"_blank\">TestSprite 3.0</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Autonomous end-to-end testing agent that uses parallel AI agents to explore apps, generate comprehensive test suites for frontend and backend, and auto-heal tests. Features parallel exploration fleet and CLI integration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag tag-specific\">workflow-specific</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n                        <span>| May 23, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Generating 50+ meaningful cases automatically is a massive jump compared to traditional approaches.\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://tinyhumans.ai/openhuman\" target=\"_blank\">OpenHuman</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI harness that is local-first, privacy-first, with persistent memory across sessions using a Memory Tree with canonicalization, temporal metadata, and source authority scoring. Integrates with 118+ tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag tag-open-source\">open-source agent</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n                        <span>| May 15, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"8000+ GitHub stars, 5000+ users in the first 7 days.\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://buildpipe.com\" target=\"_blank\">buildpipe</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Local-first pipeline automation app for developers that chains shell commands, AI calls, HTTP requests, and file operations into reusable pipelines. Trigger pipelines on schedule, file change, or webhook.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag tag-workflow\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n                        <span>| May 23, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Think of it as a local Zapier or n8n, built specifically for developers.\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"updates\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Whitelist Updates <span class=\"section-count\">15</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-announcement\">ANN</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-05-21-github-copilot-for-eclipse-is-open-source/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot for Eclipse is now open source</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Copilot for Eclipse is now open source under MIT license, allowing community contributions and transparency.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 21, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-feature\">FEAT</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Semantic issue search in Copilot Chat</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New semantic search capability allows Copilot Chat to understand and find issues based on meaning rather than just keywords.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 20, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-release\">REL</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-05-19-gemini-3-5-flash-is-generally-available-for-github-copilot/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 3.5 Flash is generally available for GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google's Gemini 3.5 Flash model delivers near-Pro coding quality at Flash-tier speed with 42% better performance on multi-turn cyber benchmarks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 19, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Early testing shows strong tool use, fast response times, and near-Pro coding quality at Flash-tier speed and cost\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-feature\">FEAT</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot cloud agent: Fast, cost-efficient models for simple tasks</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New cloud agent can automatically route simple tasks to faster, more cost-efficient models while reserving premium models for complex work.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 18, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"The biggest benefit is the flat-rate pricing model versus per-token pricing\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-release\">REL</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot Spaces API now generally available</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        The Copilot Spaces API is now generally available, enabling developers to programmatically manage and interact with Copilot Spaces.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 18, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-feature\">FEAT</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://releasebot.io/updates/anthropic/claude\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code and Opus API limits expanded with Managed Agents</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Anthropic expanded developer platform capabilities with higher API limits for Claude Code and Opus, plus new Managed Agent features. SWE-bench Verified score improved to 74.5%.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://anthropic.com\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n                        <span>| May 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-feature\">FEAT</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://codeium.com/windsurf\" target=\"_blank\">Fast and Comprehensive Code Review Features</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Windsurf (formerly Codeium) introduced Devin Review and Quick Review features, bringing advanced code review verification directly into the development workspace.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://codeium.com\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf</a>\n                        <span>| May 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Cascade is the standout feature - an agentic mode that reads your codebase\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type update-release\">REL</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Secret scanning with GitHub MCP Server now generally available</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        GitHub MCP Server for secret scanning is now generally available, enhancing security across the platform by automatically detecting leaked secrets in code.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                        <span>| May 5, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Technical Insights <span class=\"section-count\">8</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">FTC Settlement Over 'Active Listening' AI Marketing Claims</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        FTC required Cox Media Group to pay nearly $1M for deceiving customers about 'Active Listening' AI. Service didn't actually listen to conversations but resold email lists from data brokers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison | May 22, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette Agent: Extensible AI Assistant for Datasette</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        First release of Datasette Agent, integrating Simon's LLM Python library (3+ years in development) with Datasette. Includes per-user spending limits and SQL execution permissions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison | May 21, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">SpaceX-Anthropic $1.25B/Month Compute Agreement</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        SpaceX S-1 filing revealed Anthropic agreed to pay $1.25B per month through May 2029 for compute capacity across COLOSSUS and COLOSSUS II systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison | May 20, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 3.5 Flash Release and Antigravity CLI Transition</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google released Gemini 3.5 Flash and announced transition from open-source Gemini CLI (TypeScript, Apache 2.0) to closed-source Antigravity CLI (Go-based) starting June 18th.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison | May 19, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">UK Government Digital Service Backs Open Source for AI Code</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Government Digital Service recommended keeping open by default in response to NHS closing open source repos after Project Glasshook vulnerabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison | May 17, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">AI-Assisted Programming: Language Lock-In is Dead</a>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Programming languages are increasingly fungible due to AI coding agents. Companies can now more easily switch languages, reducing lock-in risk.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison, Mitchell Hashimoto | May 14, 2026\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <a href=\"#new\">new</a>\n            <a href=\"#updates\">updates</a>\n            <a href=\"#insights\">insights</a>\n            <a href=\"#about\">about</a>\n            <br><br>\n            Generated with <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a> | 2026-05-23\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
